For Ms. Youk Sambath, vaccinating a large number of people is an important part of reducing the spread of Kovid 19 and not aggravating health in case of Kovid 19 infection. Most of those who died of Kovid 19 were unvaccinated.
On the occasion of receiving the Kovid 19 vaccine on the morning of October 14, 2021, Ms. Youk Sambath emphasized, "Indeed, this is the effectiveness of the vaccine. If there is no vaccination, when our people test positive, they risk serious falls and may die. "We see that the daily death rate is mostly on our people who have not been vaccinated."
Achieving the current vaccination results, Samdech Techo Hun Sen is seen as the most important key. This result could not be achieved if Samdech Techo Hun Sen decided to delay the vaccination work.
