(Phnom Penh): Ms. Youk Sambath, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, inspected and received about 2 million doses of Kovid 19 Sinovak vaccine, with the assistance of the Chinese government and people, which arrived in Cambodia this morning, October 14, 2021. This.
On that occasion, she also gave an interview to the media about the update of vaccines that Cambodia has found and information related to the plan to reopen economic and social activities of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
In that interview, Ms. Youk Sambath pointed out that the vaccine that the government and the people of China delivered this morning was used for the third dose or dose to encourage people. So far, she said, a total of 6.8 million doses of vaccines have been donated by the Chinese government and 500,000 doses by Chinese company Sinovak.
According to Ms. Youk Sambath, so far Cambodia has received a total of 37.6 million doses of vaccines, and the vaccine in stock has reached more than 6 million doses.
