(Kandal): The Kandal Provincial Court and the Prosecutor's Office have announced their support for the patriotic ideal of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, in amending the Constitution and related laws to The President of the Senate, the President of the National Assembly, the Prime Minister and the President of the Constitutional Council of the Kingdom of Cambodia shall be the only dignitaries of Khmer nationality.
This noble initiative is a guarantee, both legal and political, for the senior dignitaries who hold the leadership positions of the four top institutions of the nation enshrined in the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia. The nation and the motherland of Cambodia, to lead the country by putting the national interest as a whole, as well as to resist outside interference in the internal affairs of the national leadership of Cambodia.
It should be noted that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on October 6, 2021, ordered the Minister of Justice, Mr. Keut Rith, to study the preparation of amendments to the Constitution and related laws to determine the Prime Minister, President of the National Assembly, and President of the Senate. And the President of the Constitutional Council is of the same Khmer nationality.
"In order to show loyalty to the nation and to avoid foreign interference, the national leaders who serve as the President of the Senate, the President of the National Assembly, the Prime Minister and the President of the Constitutional Council must have the same Cambodian nationality," he said.
