This statement was made by General Chuon Sovann on the occasion of his invitation at the 7th ASEAN Ministerial Meeting on Video Drugs on the morning of October 14, 2021. The meeting was hosted by Cambodia with the participation of leaders from ASEAN member states.
General Chuon Sovann said: "I hope that our meeting today will continue to work together to consider and initiate new ideas to ensure that all mechanisms are further strengthened and expanded. "In line with the evolving situation of the drug problem in the context of Kovid 19."
