(Kampot): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, emphasized that the transfer of Pursat and Kampot provincial governors was due to the mandate of the Pursat provincial governors on time, in accordance with the Law on Capital-Provincial Administration, not because Anything else.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng confirmed this while inviting to transfer the position of Governor of Kampot province on Wednesday afternoon, October 13, 2021. The confirmation of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng came after some questions related to the change of provincial governor.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng said that the replacement of Pursat and Kampot provincial governors started from Mr. Mao Thunin, who completed his term as Pursat provincial governor, which lasted for two years, equal to 8 years, in accordance with the Law on Capital-Provincial Management. .
Samdech Krala Hom continued that due to the expiration of his term of office while Mr. Mao Thunin was still able to manage the province and the age of not yet retired, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, transferred the management of the province by Mr. Mao Thunin Go to Kampot province and take Mr. Chiao Tai to Pursat province.
Samdech Krala Hom confirmed, "This is a real reason, there is no other reason." Not because of Pursat province or because of Kampot province. The reason is that at this time, the mandate responsible for the organization law is the law on the management of the capital-province administration.
