(Phnom Penh): General Meas Virith, Secretary-General of the National Authority for Combating Drugs, said that the global crisis of 19 continues to threaten public health, economy and global security, but all ASEAN member states continue to pay attention. Put the fight against drugs in the region as well as the world.
