"Based on past lessons and experiences, we are well aware that in order to increase the efficiency and effectiveness of the drug response, it is imperative that we all have clear mechanisms and strong will," he said. And good cooperation between all relevant institutions in the national and international framework with responsibility, patience and a broad sense of solidarity.
