(Kampot): A concrete road, a precious gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Red Cross, was inaugurated to facilitate travel. And the means of the people located in Kampong Trach I Village, Kampong Trach East Commune, Kampong Trach District, Kampot Province.
The inauguration ceremony of the new concrete road was presided over by Mr. Chheng Phalla, Chairman of Kampot Provincial Council, Mr. Chiao Tai, Provincial Governor, and was attended by provincial leaders, relevant departments, institutions around the province, authorities and local people on the 11th. October 2021.
Mr. Aun Khon, Governor of Kampong Trach District, reported that this road is made of reinforced concrete with a total length of 1,880 meters, a width of 8 meters and a thickness of 0.2 meters, and has a drainage system on both sides of the road connected to the junction from the national road. No. 33 in Kampong Trach district town to the Kampong Trach mountain natural cultural resort area.
Mr. Chiao Tai urged the people, local authorities, the armed forces of all kinds, all civil servants must work hard to preserve the values of peace and achievements that exist today for a long time for us. Together, continue to promote the development of the country and the socio-economic development to improve the lives of the people.
