Together to conserve biodiversity to preserve the planet and build a better world
Why choose China to host this General Assembly? Now let's find out some figures:
From the above, we see that China values and highly values the conservation of biodiversity because of its deep understanding of the importance of ecological balance and the inseparable relationship between human and nature. Humanity protects nature, biodiversity conservation is the protection of human life and habitat itself.
Today, most rural Chinese are shifting their focus from mining and quarrying to "selling landscapes", striving to develop eco-tourism, in which biodiversity plays an important role. Of eco-tourism with regional features. These are in line with the repeated emphasis of the Chinese leadership: "China in this era will not use natural disasters in exchange for development."
Looking back at Cambodia, through the active efforts of the current government, many people are well aware of the importance of nature conservation as well as actively participating in the campaign to conserve natural resources, develop ecotourism and protect biodiversity. Mixed. In this sense, we see that forest cover is gradually expanding, fish resources are recovering, and wildlife and rare species are also gradually increasing.
When participating in relevant activities, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, also called on the people, local authorities and officials to participate in the conservation of biodiversity to ensure the sustainability of natural resources.
There is no doubt that the relationship between man and nature is the same as the relationship between man and man, that is, if we love and value nature, nature will bring us many benefits, but if we Destroying nature, nature will also compensate for all kinds of disasters. Therefore, only by working together to preserve nature can our planet be better and more stable forever.
