Ministry of Labor announces the opening of allowances to more than 5,000 workers in the closed areas of Phnom Penh, Kandal and Sihanoukville
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training on October 12, 2021 issued a notification on the opening of allowances to 5,415 workers of 74 factories in the garment, footwear and bags sector. In the closed areas on a large scale of Phnom Penh, Takhmao and Sihanoukville.
The Ministry has shown how to pay this allowance, such as Wing Specialized Bank will send a message about the payment of 160,000 (sixteen thousand) Riels only once in accordance with the social assistance program in cash after the closure of the Royal Government. Go to the phone number you provided to the Ministry through the factory administration in the past. Workers must bring their Cambodian identity card and phone number to the nearest Wing agent.
