BEIJING, Oct. 11 (Xinhua) - A meeting with experts on the official broadcast of the Olympic Games of China Central Radio and Television was held in Beijing on October 11. The channel will be the world's first 4K sports channel, broadcast 24 hours a day via satellite.
Shen Haixiong, Deputy Minister of Propaganda of the CPC Central Committee and Director-General of the Central Radio and Television of China, attended the talks with representatives of the International Olympic Committee, intellectuals, experts and outstanding athletes. Inspiration for the upcoming Olympic Channel.
The Olympic Channel is the result of a strategic cooperation between the Central Radio and Television of China and the International Olympic Committee, it is also the only broadcasting platform in mainland China authorized by the International Olympic Committee. Also use Olympic names and five circle symbols.
Minister of Labor announces the reopening of technical and vocational education and training institutions under his supervision
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Ith Sam Heng, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, this morning, October 12, 2021, announced the reopening of Technical and Vocational Education and Training Institutions (APECs) under the Ministry of Labor. Received approval from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
Minister Ith Sam Heng said that the reopening of the ECCC It is essential to ensure the quality and efficiency training of the skilled workforce to meet the needs of the labor market. In addition, technical and vocational education and training is an important tool for the Royal Government to recover the national economy after being affected by Kovid-19.
The announcement of the reopening of technical and vocational education and training institutions under the Ministry was made through a video system (Zoom) with the participation of nearly 200 stakeholders.
First, the Ministry has developed a comprehensive set of operating standards (SOPs) to ensure the prevention of the spread of Kovid-19, in particular, there is a clear mechanism for risk assessment, closing and opening criteria, and Clear reporting system.
Second: Technical and vocational education and training institutions, the same as higher education of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, on the other hand, staff, professors, technical teachers and trainees, students (aged 15 years and older) received almost 100% vaccinated. And is continuing to receive a boost dose or a third dose.
It should be informed that currently the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training has the ECCC. 199, of which the ECCC 38 public and 161 private organizations / associations with more than 60,000 student trainees graduate and enter the job market each year.
