Public Financial Management Reform Program Beneficial to the Nation and the People of Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): The General Secretariat of the Public Financial Management Reform Steering Committee has prepared an important article entitled "The Importance of Public Financial Management Reform Program for the Nation and the People of Cambodia".
The Public Financial Management Reform Program is one of the core reform programs of the Royal Government of Cambodia to strengthen governance, which is at the core of the Rectangular Strategy and the National Strategic Development Plan.
The Public Financial Management Reform Program is a process of improving the overall budget management system to shift from an input-based and decentralized management system to an achievement-based or results-based management system and decentralization set by the Royal Government of Cambodia. That will be achieved in 2025.
