It should be noted that the tourism sector is considered by the Royal Government as a smoke-free industry as a green gold to contribute to the socio-economic development of Cambodia, while in 2019, we earned nearly 5 billion dollars from tourism, an increase of more than 12 percent. Compared to the same period in 2018 and in 2021, Cambodia is estimated to lose about $ 3 billion from this sector, according to the Ministry of Tourism.
