(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, said that the decision of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, to overcome the 19 cases of Kovid vaccine to the people in the early stages, regardless of criticism and criticism. Candles are the key to Cambodia's success in both rapid vaccination and the fight against the spread of Kovid 19.
After launching a vaccination campaign for about eight months, Cambodia has become one of the leading countries in the world to achieve the quick and effective immunization of 19 vaccines.
As of October 10, 2021, Cambodia has vaccinated more than 13.4 million Kovid 19 vaccinated people aged 6 years and over, accounting for more than 84% of the total population of 16 million. Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, considers the results of the 19-Kovid vaccination to be a proud fruit for Cambodia in fighting the spread of Kovid 19, especially to protect the lives of the people. Citizens.
Vaccination against Kovid 19 is an important measure and an important belt to protect the health of the population from the Kovid 19 outbreak. The Royal Government of Cambodia, headed by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, decided to launch the first Kovid 19 vaccination campaign on February 10, 2021 with the Chinese government-sponsored Sinofam vaccine.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's decision at that time came under a lot of pressure and criticism from civil society organizations and opposition politicians. Some civil society organizations and opposition politicians have accused Samdech Techo's decision of using the people as a tool for testing Chinese vaccines, as the Sinofam vaccine was not yet recognized by the World Health Organization.
But Samdech Techo Hun Sen still struggles to vaccinate people by using both hot and cold measures to encourage people to get vaccinated against Kovid 19. Vaccination is an important factor in determining the fate of the population from the Kovid 19 pandemic. Many poorly vaccinated countries have suffered serious public health disasters due to the outbreak of Kovid 19, especially the new "Data" virus.
For Cambodia to date, the status of the 19-Kovid epidemic appears to be in good shape and is being considered for reopening of economic and social activities. The current situation in Cambodia is seen as necessarily correlated with the results of vaccinating 19 people against Kovid.
As a result of this achievement, Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh highly praised Samdech Techo Hun Sen's decision to overcome criticism and criticism in vaccinating the people. For Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh, if Samdech Techo Al-Ek on vaccination, believing the opinion of civil society organizations and some opposition politicians, it is not possible to conclude the fate of the people and the nation in the face of the epidemic of Kovid 19. .
