- c. If the people do not meet the above conditions, the leader of the voter registration team will decide to reject the registration application by issuing a rejection form 1009, and the rejected people can complain to the Commune / Sangkat Council within No later than 3 days after receiving the rejection form 1009 and the procedure to follow the election law until the Constitutional Council.
* Third: Data transmission
Every day, the voter registration team must send the computerized data to the Department of Voter Data Management and the Voter List for the department to monitor on a regular basis.
