Notice! Kampot Provincial Administration and Kamchay Dam Technical Team Open Drainage from Reservoir
(Kampot): Kampot Provincial Administration and Technical Team of Kamchay Dam announced that the gradual opening of drainage in Kamchay Hydropower Reservoir took place at 11 am on October 11, 2021. Later, the water level gradually increased due to rainfall.
