(Phnom Penh): The Minister of Posts and Telecommunications, Mr. Chea Van Det, told the ASEAN Minister that Cambodia is ready to join the ASEAN Member States towards a safe and environmentally friendly cyber space.
The 6th ASEAN Ministerial Conference on Cyber Security and Singapore Cyber Security Week 2021 is organized under the theme: Learn to live with Kovid-19 and aim to exchange experiences and enhance cooperation between countries in the region in building the Internet. Safer and more durable.
Minister Chea Van Det emphasized four areas of cooperation, including:
1: Strengthen cyber security capacity by focusing on human resource training and cyber security related training.
2: Increasing closer cooperation in sharing information, cyber security threats.
4: Protect digital data securely and ensure effective sharing in daily work.
