(Phnom Penh): The Spokesperson of the Senate of Cambodia on October 6, 2021 announced his support for the noble initiative with deep patriotic ideals of the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen in amending the Constitution and the law. Relevant to determine that the President of the Senate, the President of the National Assembly, the Prime Minister and the President of the Constitutional Council of the Kingdom of Cambodia must be the only dignitaries of Cambodian nationality.
