Authorities decide not to allow people to visit the Anlong Chrey dam in Ponhea Krek district, Tbong Khmum province after not implementing health rules
(Tbong Khmum): Authorities and authorities decided to block tourists from visiting the water area at the Anlong Chrey Dam, located in Ponhea Krek district, Tbong Khmum province, after a large crowd and did not cooperate in the implementation of the duty. Masks maintain individual safety gaps to prevent Kovid 19.
According to Mr. Hak Sok Makara, today, tourists continue to visit the area in large numbers as yesterday. Seeing this situation, the competent authorities, in cooperation with the health officials, also distributed alcohol masks and publicized the health rules, but all the tourists refused to cooperate.
He added that as people refused to cooperate as of 3:30 pm today, the authorities decided to block tourists from visiting the water at the dam to reduce the number of gatherings. Risks can occur at any time, especially the spread of Kovid 19.
Nevertheless, both the authorities and the health officials continued to call on the people who visit the Anlong Chrey Dam to cooperate in implementing the health rules and to follow the instructions of the authorities to prevent and prevent the transmission of Kovid 19. That fun place.
