Borey Kaing Meng informs customers who bought a plot of land to build a house, contact Borey directly to solve to avoid fraud by crooks
According to the letter informing customers who bought a plot of land to build a villa in Borey Kaing Meng about the spread of false information that caused serious confusion on Borey Kaing Meng, it is confirmed that Borey Kaing Meng is a registered Borey developer. Since 2007. Borey Kaing Meng has a valid land title (a hard copy) with a legal development plan licensed by the relevant ministries and authorities.
Recently, some crooks used the names of hundreds of clients in Borey Kaing Meng, inflating the news that Borey Kaing Meng has been selling plots of land for more than 10 years without transferring the correct land title.
Borey Kaing Meng also stated that it will take legal action against those who defame Borey in any form.
In order to know the real information, to avoid being cheated by the crooks of Borey Kaing Meng, we request that customers contact the new office of Borey Kaing Meng every working hour. Address: Building 23, Street 261, Sangkat Toek Laak 2, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh, or Tel: 017 888 816/077 322 322.
