(Phnom Penh): In order to share knowledge to the public, the Regulatory Authority has prepared an article explaining alternative governance.
The Board of Directors may be replaced by another person in accordance with the conditions and procedures set forth in the Board of Governance or the provisions in force.
In cases where there is no provision for the conditions and procedures as stated in the original sentence, the Board of Governors shall be replaced by the following conditions:
1: If the trustee is a natural person, this trustee is replaced
(B) by an absolute majority decision of all the mayors when the mayors retire or refuse to perform their duties or are unworthy to perform their duties;
2. If the trustee is a legal entity, this trustee is replaced when the trustee ceases his activities and is cleared or dissolved.
The replacement of the Board of Directors is possible only if the conditions and procedures for the replacement of the Board of Directors are specified in the letter of the Board of Governors or the regulations in force (Law on the Board of Governors, 2019 Law on the Organization and Functioning of the Financial Services Authority). Yes, Bank 2021). Commentary: "The country is prosperous and the people are prosperous, China celebrates the National Day with joy"
