(Phnom Penh): Mr. Wang Winthean, Ambassador of the People's Republic of China to Cambodia, on October 1, 2021, presented a message congratulating the 72nd anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
In this message, the Ambassador highlighted the history of the struggle of the Chinese Communist Party and many achievements of China under the leadership of the Chinese Communist Party.
The following is the full text of Wang Vinthean's speech:
On the occasion of the 72nd Anniversary of the Establishment of the People's Republic of China, on behalf of the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia, I sincerely wish all my compatriots who are working, studying and living in Cambodia, and a sincere thank you to all of you. All circles of the two countries always pay attention to and support the friendship between China and Cambodia.
Recalling the past, the Chinese Communist Party has united to lead the Chinese people and continue to struggle to move forward. Through many developments and developments, overcoming all obstacles and achieving glorious achievements, successfully forming the unique socialist path of China.
The effectiveness of the continuous development drive innovation strategy has provided strong support for the construction of new development models that take the cycle in China and the mutual promotion of the domestic and foreign cycles.
Following the world trend in the face of unprecedented global change in a hundred years, China adheres to peace, development, cooperation and common success. Adhere to step on the path of peaceful development, promote the construction of a new type of international relations, promote the building of a common destiny for humanity, promote the construction of high-quality "belts and roads" for development, take China's new development as a new opportunity For the world.
Cooperate with countries and people who love peace, promote common values of peace, development, justice, truth, democracy and freedom for all mankind, continue to adhere to non-confrontational cooperation, open, non-closed, mutually beneficial and successful The principle of unilateral benefit against the doctrine of the use of power and politics, oppression always stands with the correct history and progress of mankind.
Practical economic and trade cooperation between the two countries has grown despite the impact of the virus. Major projects in the "Belt and Road" cooperation, such as the Sihanoukville Special Economic Zone, Phnom Penh-Sihanoukville Expressway, Siem Reap Angkor Thmey International Airport, etc., have been smoothly promoted.
Many high quality Cambodian agricultural products are constantly exported to the Chinese market, such as rice, bananas, and mangoes. The two countries have closely coordinated and supported each other, expressing a voice of justice and truth on issues related to each other's core interests and common interests.
