Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh: The army not only plays a key role in maintaining peace, but also actively participates in rescuing people in emergencies (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense The Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) has not only played a key role in finding and maintaining the hard-won peace, but has also been actively involved in rescuing people in emergencies.
