This statement by the Minister of National Defense of Cambodia came after the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces actively participated in the campaign to vaccinate 19 people against the disease of Kovid 19 in the red area in Phnom Penh and the districts and continue to give People in other provinces.
In addition, especially in the phase of Cambodia being involved in the fight against Kovid 19, while in some provinces along the Cambodian-Thai border are suffering from floods, the army forces are actively involved in rescue operations. Evacuate the flooded people to a safe place with various forces.
