Senior official of the Ministry of Public Works: Procedure to save personal special license plates for use with new cars requires 4 million Riels
(Phnom Penh): Ms. Koy Sodany, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport and Chair of the Inter-Ministerial Committee for the Management of Sales of Special License Plates, stated that in order to keep her own special license plate printed with the letter "Cambodia" on the side To use another of its new cars must follow proper legal procedures and pay a budget of 4 million riels.
Ms. Koy Sodani stated that a vehicle can only be registered as a vehicle and cannot be exceeded because it is the identity of the vehicle that can be used for both registration and personal identification, and the owner can also apply. Keep the license plate when selling the car to the new owner and keep the license plate to store another new car that has not been registered by submitting to the Ministry of Public Works and Transport.
Please note that the launch of the sale of special personal registration numbers for cars in order to provide options to citizens who can afford to choose a special license plate can be customized and facilitate the tax collection procedure. Even more so. This shows the attention of the Royal Government of Cambodia to facilitate people to buy car registration numbers easily through the automation system of the technological age.
The properties of the personal license plate are printed with the letter "Cambodia" at the top and a combination of Latin numbers or letters from 1 to 8 digits printed in the middle and QR Code on the right. Of the license plate, and this special license plate can also be stored when the car is transferred.
