Minister of Tourism: Kep tourism destination must be connected with other coastal provinces in order to compete with neighboring countries
(Kep): The Minister of Tourism, Mr. Thong Khon, said that at this stage of the Kovid crisis, the promotion of Kep tourist destinations could not be separated from the tourist destinations of Kampot and other coastal provinces, so there must be Connect tourism destinations together to increase the potential to be able to compete attractively with neighboring countries.
This statement was made by Minister Thong Khon during the meeting to pass the draft of Kep Tourism Development Master Plan 2021-2035 at Kep Provincial Hall on the morning of September 29, 2021, with the participation of Mr. Som Piseth, Governor of Kep Province and the leaders of a number of ministries and institutions, both in person and through video conferencing.
On that occasion, Mr. Ny Phally, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism and Chairman of the Secretary of the Inter-Ministerial Commission for the Study of Tourism Development Planning in Kep Province, said that in the study of the master plan, the inter-ministerial working group also studied the experience of urban development. Tourism of some countries, such as France.
He said that in the context of the Kovid-19 crisis, Cambodia can not take a single goal to compete with neighboring countries, that is, it is necessary to require the organization of close goals as a common goal, such as coastal areas with provinces. Koh Kong, Preah Sihanouk, Kampot and Kep provinces.
At this point, Minister Thong Khon also stated that "the promotion of tourist destinations in Kep can not be separated from the tourist destinations in Kampot and other coastal provinces, so there must be a joint tourism destination to increase. "The potential to compete attractively with neighboring countries."
The Minister accepted the request from the meeting on cooperation with the administrations of the coastal provinces to develop a master plan for tourism development for each province.
Mr. Ny Phally continued that during this period of the Kovid crisis, the tourism marketing strategy of Kep province has promoted the reputation of tourism, safety, health and delicious food. And so on.
At this point, Minister Thong Khon expressed his support and continued that through the draft master plan will be turned into a destination for second home tourism, elderly tourism. He said that the people of France, Japan, China, which are rich in the elderly, also seek health tourism, so Kep must have a strategy to attract these tourists.
In the draft plan for the development of tourism in Kep province, there are four strategic angles for the development of tourism poles, including the old pole of Kep city, the pole of Angkor area, the pole of Phnom Vly pole, the archipelago area, and will also establish an additional tourism innovation center. .
The draft Kep Tourism Development Master Plan 2021-2035 is divided into 12 chapters. The meeting discussed and received opinions from the Minister, the Governor and the leaders of other ministries and institutions to correct, adjust and reduce the content of this draft law.
Please be informed that the Royal Government has set the strategic goal of Kep Tourism Development to become a quiet, high-end luxury tourism destination that is attractive and competitive in the region and the world. Kovid-19 Daily Report: "The number of people infected on Earth has reached 233.64 million cases, 4.78 million deaths, 210.45 million cases have been cured, 170 countries have more than 10,000 cases." Go up »
