Commentary: China builds a society where people have a decent standard of living in all aspects, greatly promoting the overall development of the world
BEIJING, July 1 (Xinhua) - China announced to the world that China has already built a society in which its people are relatively well-off. As the international community appreciates China's achievements, it is becoming more and more curious what kind of society its people are living in.
According to White Paper data, in 1978, the average per capita income of the Chinese people was only 171 Chinese yuan per year, but by 2020 it reached 32,189 yuan. Chinese yuan. In particular, China has historically solved the problem of extreme poverty, which is the most prominent index of a society in which the people are relatively well-off in all aspects.
It should be noted that in the process of building a society where the people have a relatively prosperous life, China has become the country with the largest increase in forest resources and the largest tree planting area in the world, which makes the Chinese people have a better ecological environment. Better. By 2020, China's preference for eco-ecology will reach 89.5 percent.
As the world's largest and most populous developing country, China has decided to build a society in which people have a decent standard of living, which is a huge contribution to world peace and development. .
At the same time, China has built a society in which the people are relatively well-off in all aspects of the process of promoting communication with the world, also greatly promoting the overall development of the world. Since 2006, China has been the largest contributor to global economic growth for 15 consecutive years, with an average contribution rate of more than 30 percent.
