(Phnom Penh): The Constitutional Council has found that the Law on Investment and the Law on the Amendment of the new Article 18 of the Law on the Amendment are unconstitutional.
This decision was made at the plenary session of the Constitutional Council on the morning of September 29, 2021. The meeting was chaired by Dr. M. Chhun Lim, President of the Constitutional Council, and was attended by members of the Constitutional Council.
Prior to the review and decision meeting, the Constitutional Council also summoned the relevant officials to clarify and explain the two laws on September 28, 2021.
It should be noted that the above two laws were approved by the National Assembly in the plenary session on September 9, 2021.
