The Chinese Communist Party Central Committee published an article entitled "What we need to do to continue to be successful"
BEIJING, Sept. 27 (Xinhua) - After publishing an important article entitled "Why We Can Succeed", the People's Daily, a newspaper of the CPC Central Committee, published an article entitled "Why We Can Succeed". What can we do to continue to be successful? ”
This year marks the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China, and the party has led China to achieve the goal of the first 100 years of struggle, which is to build a society in which people have a decent standard of living. The article entitled "What we need to do to continue to be successful" shows that unity is the basis of success.
In the context of multifaceted interests and diversity of needs being further expanded, the strong leadership core of the Chinese Communist Party needs to adhere to the holding of the people as the core, representing the fundamental interests of the overwhelming majority of the people. Really consider and coordinate interests in various fields well, inspire vitality and productive forces in society to gather the strongest forces that strive together to the maximum.
