General knowledge: What are the causes of volcanic eruptions, cracks in the ocean, mountain ranges, earthquakes?
So far, 30 technological labels have been found. The tectonic plates often collide, slip apart, or slip into contact with each other, as this constant motion creates many features on the Earth's surface, such as mountain ranges, ocean ditches, landslides, and volcanic eruptions.
In fact, the Himalayas in northern India, the Ang Mountains in South America, volcanic eruptions in the Philippines, Indonesia, Italy, earthquakes in Japan, Haiti, ditches in the Pacific Ocean, as well as the archipelago. All due to the movement of the Earth's tectonic plate.
