(Banteay Meanchey): Border Guard Force 503, in cooperation with the 51st Infantry Brigade and the 911th Border Police, arrested 37 Cambodian-Thai workers, including 26 Cambodian and 11 Thai workers, intending to cross the border illegally. Thailand enters Cambodia illegally.
