The following is the full text of the announcement of the General Department of Taxation: The Constitutional Council held a discussion and review on the Investment Law and the new Article 18 of the Audit Law.
(Phnom Penh): The Constitutional Council this morning, September 28, 2021, opened a discussion and review on the Law on Investment and the new Article 18 of the Law on Auditing.
Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth and his colleagues briefed the Constitutional Council on the progress of the drafting process of the new Article 18 of the Law on the Amendment to Article 18 of the Law on the Audit of the Kingdom of Cambodia. In particular, the goals, objectives and main reasons and some necessities that lead to the proposed amendments to this law.
It should also be noted that in accordance with the provisions of Article 21 of the Law on the Organization and Functioning of the Constitutional Council in reviewing the constitutionality of the law, the Constitutional Council has the right to invite one or more persons to clarify or provide relevant documents. . All individuals, public or private, must respect and comply with the invitation and request of the Constitutional Council.
The Minister of Health of Laos said this while receiving the 200,000 doses of Kovid 19 vaccine, with the assistance of the Royal Government of Cambodia and the people of Cambodia this morning, September 28, 2021.
