Therefore, from January 1, 2022 onwards, the workers in the textile, garment, footwear and travel products and bags industry will have a minimum wage of 194 (one hundred and ninety-four) US dollars per month for full workers. Rights and 192 (one hundred and ninety-two) US dollars per month for probationary workers.
