(Prey Veng): Police in Prey Veng province have dismantled a case of killing a woman in the development of Golden Finance Svay Antor branch in Prey Veng province on September 26, 2021. So far, the police have arrested a suspect as the head of the district branch. Svay Antor to ask why there is a dispute in the company.
Prey Veng Deputy Police Commissioner Pov Chivi told Fresh News on September 27, 2021 that with the report from Svay Antor District Police Inspector that there was a case of death at the room in the development of Golden Finance Svay Antor Branch. Svay Antor district, Prey Veng province. Mom Chenda, a 27-year-old female from Village 8, Sangkat Kampong Leav, Prey Veng City, Prey Veng Province, was an employee of Vivat Gold Finance Branch
