Mr. Pov Chivi added that according to the conclusion of the competent experts, according to the examination of the scene, the explanation of the mother of the body and the examination of the body, the body died due to the use of force to suffocate, suffocation, death is really a case of murder. After completing the procedure, the authorities handed over the body to the family to take to the traditional ceremony.
