Finally, I would like to call on the public as well as the staff of Dangkor Referral Hospital not to be confused about the story of Dr. Chhim Chivi regarding the removal of him from the director of Dangkor Referral Hospital.
After posting this message, a person named Nheb Phanath was brought in by the authorities for questioning and explained the reasons as well as other reasons that led to the removal of the director of Dangkor District Hospital.
After listening to the authorities' instructions and the presentation of evidence and relevant documents, the person made a mistake and released a video apologizing publicly, acknowledging that the removal of the director of the Dangkor District Referral Hospital was the right thing for the class. So lead the people, please do not be confused anymore.
