Mr. Tep Kongkea said: "The monks, the committee, the abbot and the students living in the pagodas in Phnom Penh have already taken 19 samples of Kovid virus, 8975 out of 150 pagodas were taken by the health team. "19 samples of Kovid 19 were positive for Kovid 19, of which 97 were monks, 9 were abbots, 15 were nuns and 20 were students."
