According to the Facebook page of the Samdech Techo Young Volunteer Doctors Association, the association would like to thank Unicity for donating $ 100,000 and $ 29,251 to its members for contributing to the Volunteer Doctors Association. Samdech Techo Youth in the campaign against Kovid 19, including the event on February 20.
