Deputy PM Yim Chhay Ly to Statement on Cambodian Government Commitment at Food Summit in New York via Video
(Phnom Penh): At the invitation of Antonio Guterres, Secretary-General of the United Nations, Deputy Prime Minister Yim Chhay Ly, Chairman of the Council for Agricultural and Rural Development, High Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, will make a statement on Commitment of the Royal Government of Cambodia at the Food Security Summit hosted by the Secretary-General of the United Nations in New York via video recording.
Meanwhile, Deputy Prime Minister Yim Chhay Ly will make a statement between 8:00 pm and 10:00 pm in New York City, 7:00 am to 9:00 am in Phnom Penh on September 24. 2021. Samdech Techo Hun Sen Wants to See Good Cooperation on Human Rights Issues with UN Human Rights Mission
Human rights issues in Cambodia are sensitive and there have always been conflicting views between the Royal Government of Cambodia and UN human rights officials in the past. In a video discussion meeting on Wednesday afternoon, September 22, 2021, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Mr. Vitith Montaboun, the new UN human rights envoy to Cambodia, had a frank discussion on the issue. This.
According to Mr. Eang Sophalleth, Samdech Techo Hun Sen's personal assistant, after the meeting, Mr. Vitith Montaboun asked Samdech Techo on four issues, including: 1: Cambodia's priorities on human rights, 2: Lessons about Kovid 19 in prison, 3: Expansion of economic space, civil society and politics, and 4: Find out what he should do to support Cambodia on human rights issues.
In response to this request, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also spoke candidly and openly. Samdech Techo emphasized that from the beginning until now, the priority right for Cambodia is the right to life, which is a right in accordance with both the Constitution and international conventions. Samdech Techo continued that in order to maintain this right to life, Cambodia must maintain peace and social stability, along with vaccinating the people.
With regard to all 19 Kovid cases in prison, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia attaches great importance to women prisoners and those who have children by relocating them or relocating them. Go to a new place to avoid Kovid 19 infection. In addition, Cambodia does not overlook the general convicts, Cambodia has already vaccinated them in two doses and is ready to give a third dose.
Regarding the expansion of economic space, civil society and politics, Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government, emphasized that Cambodia wants to have a good social, economic and political environment with the space of democracy.
In particular, the fourth point is that Samdech Techo wants to have the cooperation of Mr. Vitith Montaboun first, that is, to create an atmosphere of mutual trust, with a constructive name on the issue of human rights that does not fall. Blame each other.
According to Mr. Eang Sophalleth, during the meeting, Mr. Vitit Montaboun also expressed his deep appreciation to the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, for taking action to vaccinate the Cambodian people quickly to prevent smallpox. 19.
