The Kanben and Pchum Ben festivals in 2021 take place from the 1st of Roach to the 14th of Roach, which is from September 22 to October 6, 2021, and what is very different is that it is performed. Go during the period when Kovid 19 was invading everywhere. This is why the Royal Government has advised the Cambodian people who are Buddhists to be very careful and strictly implement the health rules.
