The source said that the car was driving from west to east from the bridge, then the car hit a fruit stall named Chhean Sokkoy, female, 41 years old, in Svay Ath Krom village, Prek Tamak commune, Khsach Kandal district, causing serious injuries and Another fruit seller, 24-year-old Rith, was seriously injured in the same commune.
