Since 1999, out of compassion and to alleviate the hardships of the family, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen have always considered the triplets to be children and now consider them Samdech's grandchildren. At the same time, Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit always provide financial support and food items to the family to alleviate the difficulties and facilitate the upbringing of children.
