Mr. Svay Dot claimed that all these donations were not donations from the Royal Government, donations from the Cambodian Red Cross or donations from political parties. On the contrary, all these gifts are the gifts born of the sincere and thoughtful hearts of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, who realized the real hardships for the people who gave birth to triplets. Exactly.
