(Kampong Chhnang): In order for people to be vaccinated against Kovid 19, which is a strict order of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, even though the people are in remote areas, the doctors have overcome all difficulties. Inject them.
In fact, on September 21, 2021, a group of volunteer doctors of the Air Force Command traveled a long way to vaccinate people living in Kovid 19 in Trangel, Po and Svay Rumpear communes. In Kampong Leng district, Kampong Chhnang province. The three communes of Kampong Leng district are remote areas.
Based on Samdech Techo Hun Sen's Instruction on Accelerating the Implementation of the 19 Kovid Vaccination Campaign, General Soeng Samnang, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the Royal Cambodian Air Force, arranged for a team of volunteer doctors and A team of 40 Air Force assistants went to the three communes in Kampong Chhnang province to vaccinate people.
Lt. Gen. Kong Mony, Deputy Commander in Chief of Staff, confirmed that this was the second time that Air Force volunteer doctors had launched a vaccination campaign in the three communes in Kampong Leng district.
Based on the first immunization report, the Air Force medics vaccinated 4,433 people. For today, the Air Force volunteer doctors injected 1,816 people.
During the visit to the medical team this morning, General Soeng Samnang brought the greetings of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen to all the volunteer doctors. The general also brought Samdech Techo's order, which instructed doctors to pay attention to providing vaccines to the people.
