Senior Minister Sun Chanthol added that the Ministry of Public Works has also worked with JICA, the World Bank and all relevant government agencies to study and plan to reduce transportation costs in Cambodia at a lower cost and more efficient. Water transport is also an important part of this master plan.
The Senior Minister said that the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port is an important national economic gateway for exchanging Cambodia's agricultural and agro-industrial products to regional and international markets, so the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port is an important port next to National Road No. 1. Convenient traffic, especially container trucks crossing National Road No. 1 to the port.
