(Phnom Penh): Wing agents across the country have volunteered to donate a total of $ 45,000 to the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia to support Kantha Bopha Hospital, a hospital that provides health care to children in Cambodia for almost a year. 30 years free, quality and non-discriminatory.
The Wing Agent Fund was established in August 2021 to raise funds to support their local social causes. Financial support for Kantha Bopha Hospital operations is crucial, especially during the face of the Kovid-19 outbreak.
Mr. Suron Chheang Sreng, Managing Director of Consumer Marketing Business, Wing Bank, said, “We are very proud of our agency's generous and dedicated work for the cause of children in Cambodia through our partnership with the Agency Fund. Wing donates to the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia.
"We have nearly 10,000 Wing agencies in every district in Cambodia, which is why we are able to raise funds for this cause," he said. "Our agents not only provide financial services to meet the daily needs of the Cambodian people, they also donate personal resources to help the most vulnerable in their communities."
Pheng Sareth, 61, a Wing agent in Sihanoukville, also donated $ 100 to the cause, saying, "I remember when my grandson was seriously ill it was hard to find. A reliable hospital for treatment. Kantha Bopha Hospital has given my grandchildren new hope and new life. Through the Wing Agency Foundation, I can express my gratitude to Kantha Bopha Hospital. ”
Mr. Ros Silva, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and Executive Director of Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia, thanked Wing for its support of the Children's Hospital during this difficult time.
The hospital spends about $ 40 million on operations each year. More than 639,260 children have been examined and treated and 133,026 critically ill patients have been admitted to Kantha Bopha Hospital for free in 5 locations by 2020.
Wing has played a key role in promoting the financial environment in Cambodia and facilitating easy cash flow, especially for women in their communities.
Wing users can contribute to this charity by donating to Riel Account No. 5559 or Dollar Account No. 5558 or through Wing agents throughout Cambodia free of charge. Wing Bank guarantees that 100% of the charitable donations will go to Kantha Bopha Hospital.
