Mr. Sok Sopheak commended the past efforts of the Cambodian-Russian side in promoting cooperation on priority investment projects, as the two sides pledged at the first meeting in 2016.
Mr. Sam Heng Bora, Undersecretary of State, Ministry of Commerce and Co-Chair of the Expert Working Group for the Cambodian Side, led the Expert Working Group on the five investment projects proposed by the Russian side, including:
First: Cyprus roof and sewer production project Second: KAMAZ truck assembly production and service network Third: Supply of solid waste incinerator Fourth: Production of thermal insulation mixture from husk or straw and 5: Project to supply fast internet equipment.
