North Korea's state-run KCNA news agency quoted the foreign ministry as saying: "These are the most dangerous actions and no one wants to see ... because it will cause a strategic imbalance in The Asia-Pacific region will push for more nuclear weapons competition. "Such actions really show that the United States is the mastermind behind the overthrow of the international non-proliferation system."
