The great disciple Dr. Nhek Buntha continued that he expressed that the inscription of the Trinity is equal to the construction of a Buddha, so the construction of the Great Temple to deposit the Trinity is two great merits: 1: It is a Dhamma that brings happiness and death, 2: It is the temple where the Trinity is placed, the Buddhists who go there worship.
According to the plan, the Cambodian Buddhist Cultural Center will build four temples and a stupa in the center of the four temples. Currently, the center is continuing to build the Cholamani Stupa to house 84,000 Buddha statues, which is 300 square meters with 29 nine-story galleries in the style of Angkor.
