On the evening of Thursday, September 16, 2021, a team of doctors rescued two men with positive Kovid 19 through surgery. The first woman, a 27-year-old woman with a weak cervix, gave birth to a boy weighing 3.8 kg and the second woman, a 21-year-old woman with a weak cervix, gave birth to a daughter weighing 3 kg.
On the evening of Friday, September 17, 2021, doctors rescued two more Kovid 19 positive women through surgery. The first woman, 29 years old, had epilepsy, gave birth to a baby boy weighing 3.7 kg, and the second woman, 34 years old, had a weak cervix and gave birth to a boy weighing 3.1 kg. .
Another case, on Saturday, September 18, 2021, gives birth to another positive pregnant woman. The woman had twins and gave birth naturally. The 35-year-old woman gave birth to her first son weighing 2.8 kg and her second son weighing 3.1 kg.
With the achievement of the mission to give birth to these 19 HIV-positive women, the public has been praised and appreciated by the medical team for their efforts.
Announces 321 New Kampot CPP Members
(Kampot): Mr. Chiao Tay, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Committee of the Cambodian People's Party in Kampot Province, announced the inclusion of 321 new party members of Kampot City to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party.
The announcement ceremony was held on September 18, 2021 at Kampot Provincial Hall with the participation of about 400 leaders and relevant members.
On that occasion, Mr. Chiao Tai said that through the achievements left by the party for the past 42 years, starting from the January 7 victory, the Cambodian People's Party has achieved unimaginable social change.
At the same time, Mr. Chiao Tai also asked the new members of the Cambodian People's Party to participate in good activities to serve the social interests in the local community in order to gain the love, satisfaction and respect of the people.
He confirmed that the inclusion of this new member to strengthen and increase preparations for the Commune / Sangkat Council elections of the fifth mandate on June 5, 2022.
At the same time, Mr. Chiao Tai also donated about 7,420,000 Riels to the Kampot Municipal Party and new members and provided some important documents, including party shirts and hats.
