He will also continue to act as a bridge of friendship between civil society to increase solidarity and fraternity between Cambodian and Chinese civil society in order to join the Royal Government of Cambodia in the development of society.
On behalf of the President of the Cambodian-Chinese Buddhist Association, Venerable Zhao Xin, Vice President of the Association, affirmed that the 10,000-strong donation today is a testament to the friendly relations between the Buddhists of our two countries. Strong steel relations between the two nations of our country and also to meet some practical needs to contribute to the Royal Government of Cambodia on preventing the spread of Kovid 19.
