Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded that countries with advanced economies in terms of services have made significant contributions to the economy. That is why the Royal Government of Cambodia is willing to spend hundreds of millions of dollars to buy vaccines for people to develop immunity to Kovid 19, which leads to the reopening of economic activities in the future to recover billions. Dollars for the Cambodian economy.
