US President Joe Biden on Wednesday (Washington time) announced a new tripartite alliance with Australia and the United Kingdom to help strengthen allied naval capabilities in the Indo-Pacific region with the promise that Will assist Australia in building nuclear-powered submarines that will strengthen its ability to withstand threats.
