BEIJING, Sept. 16 (Xinhua) - On September 16, 2021, on the occasion of the 20th anniversary of the founding of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization, a forum for the exchange of information between the Chinese media and the Shanghai Cooperation Organization was initiated by the Central Radio and Television CGTN. China has been officially launched.
Shen Haixiong said that since the outbreak of Kovid 19, the media of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization (SCO) countries need to increase exchanges and cooperation more than ever before, should adhere to ethics and responsibility. Society spreads truth and truth to the people and opposes rumors and discrimination.
