(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of Cambodia is planning to re-launch economic activities in a new direction in the future, in which the tourism sector, which is the most affected sector, will also resume operations as a first step. May open domestic tourism and the next step to open international tourism.
Despite the reopening of tourists, the Royal Government of Cambodia has set a priority plan by selecting vaccinated tourists, ensuring that there is no risk of transmission of Kovid 19 outbreaks.
With the reopening of tourism activities, will there be any foreign tourists visiting Cambodia? At a time when Cambodia has not yet closed the February 20 community event, while the number of 19 cases of Kovid is still being discovered?
In particular, the tourism industry insists that the Royal Government announce a specific time to attract tourists to be ready to visit Cambodia, while Thailand and Vietnam have both announced their reception times. Back.
Chhay Sivlin, President of the Cambodian Association of Travel Agents, said: “I am confident that there will be more tourists coming to Cambodia because in the past, overseas partners have always asked about the reopening of Cambodia's economy and tourism. This confirms that they have visitors in hand and are waiting for the reopening to bring tourists to Cambodia, so when it opens, we believe that there will be tourists in Cambodia.
She added: "I still believe that there are tourists coming to Cambodia, even if the number of visitors is small, in fact, the number of tourists coming to Cambodia now is not as many as before the outbreak of Kovid 19. Come gradually from one guest to another with word of mouth and bring other tourists to Cambodia.
She added that for safe tourism, Cambodia will receive all vaccines, which ensures the safety of both tourists and tourists. It is thought that most of the visitors will be Europeans, but also depending on the flight, if the flight is ready, it can transport a lot of tourists, but if not arranged, it will be difficult for tourists to travel Who wants to come too.
She said that in addition to Europe, Cambodia's neighboring countries are also looking forward to the opening of Cambodia's tourism, such as Thailand, so Cambodia also has high potential to attract tourists from other countries.
For Mr. Ho Vandy, Advisor to the Cambodian Tourism Association, said that in the absence of a recent outbreak of Kovid 19, so the plan of the Royal Government and the parties involved in the process of re-accepting tourists, and this is also a congratulations to the suppliers. Travel services, such as tourist siblings as well.
He added that the relevant ministries are currently discussing measures for tourists to visit Cambodia due to the requirement of tourists to spend 14 days for a long time. Guests lose a lot of time and money and have little time to travel, so hopefully all relevant ministries will consider this decision.
He added that the countries that have the best control of Kovid 19 are China, Europe and Israel. According to the observation after China is the European region that has controlled the disease 19 well, so safe tourists can come from these countries.
