Noodles open new page, exported to Vietnam market
(Phnom Penh): While recognizing the quality and delicious taste of national noodle products, the company, which was founded by Khmer children and is the first Khmer flavored noodle company in Cambodia, has exported national noodle products for the first time. Take the Vietnam market, which is another great new step in expanding the scope of Cambodian products into the regional market today and to the world in the future.
The inauguration of the new journey of national noodles to Vietnam was held with the press conference on the morning of September 13, 2021 with the participation of the management of noodles and Distributors in Vietnam, as well as many other distinguished guests.
Ms. Chheng Sokuntheavy, Director of One More Manufacturing (Mi Cheat), said that this first step in exporting is a reflection of confidence in the quality of national noodles at an international standard level in line with market demand in neighboring countries. . This export provides another new opportunity for national noodles to appear in the international market, as the quality and taste are already recognized by the local people.
Mr. Lao Van, CEO of One More Manufacturing Co., Ltd., said that this export has really provided a lot of positives to the noodles, in line with the process of recognizing the quality and delicious taste of noodles from the people in The district in particular is proud that local packaged noodles are present in the international market.
Mr. Lao Van added that the noodles were produced to the right standard from the very beginning to achieve the vision of a food product that everyone recognizes, and today is another step forward that the company has strived. Strive to promote the food packaging sector in Cambodia.
Ms. Hiv Ratana, Representative of National Noodle Distribution Partner, said that this is the first step in cooperation with Noodle National and believed in the quality and safety of this product and conducted a very detailed study on the quality and taste of noodles. As well as the demand for instant noodles in the Vietnamese market.
Ms. Hiv Ratana added that the demand for instant noodles in Vietnam has increased significantly in the context of the outbreak of Kovid 19. Believe that the national noodle products will get the support of the people there. In order to meet the conditions for export, the quality and safety of food have been carefully studied and evaluated by the relevant ministries and institutions on standards and standards to ensure safe and quality exports.
