The Prime Minister made this remark on the occasion of Samdech together with Mr. Wang Yi, State Councilor and Minister of Foreign Affairs of China, presiding over the official handover ceremony of the Techo Heritage National Stadium on the afternoon of September 12, 2021.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "Cambodia pursues a policy of peaceful, cooperative, permanently neutral. We are friends with all countries. No one is an enemy except the terrorists, who are our enemies." "Depending on who dares to help us."
At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also thanked the Royal Government and the people of China, especially to Chinese President Xi Jinping, HE Le Ker Chheang for supporting the development project in Cambodia and especially thanked for Reduce the death of the Cambodian people in the disaster of the epidemic of Kovid 19, and although Cambodia has a lot of Kovid 19, but the hospitalization and mortality rate is low because people have received enough vaccines.
This straightforward response was claimed by the Prime Minister that it was not a joke, nor was it a scandal, but it was true because China really helped Cambodia a lot, including infrastructure. Thousands of kilometers, insurance system, electricity and other assistance.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stressed that without China, Cambodia would not have had as many vaccines as 19 for the Cambodian people as they do today, and this vaccination has saved the lives of the Cambodian people.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen's speech was made on the occasion of Samdech and Mr. Wang Yi, State Councilor and Minister of Foreign Affairs of the People's Republic of China, presiding over the official handover ceremony of Techo Heritage National Stadium on the afternoon of the 12th. This September 2021.
