According to the Siem Reap Provincial Police, the appointment ceremony of the new Siem Reap Provincial Police Commissioner will be held on September 13, 2021 at the Provincial Hall, presided over by General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner, representing Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng. .
It should be noted that Brigadier General Teng Channath, Deputy Commissioner of Police of Siem Reap Province, is currently in charge of traffic planning and he has been appointed as the new Commissioner of Siem Reap Province in place of Major General Tit Narong. Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): A bilateral meeting between Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, and Mr. Wang Yi, State Councilor and Minister of Foreign Affairs of the People's Republic of China, was held at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Cambodia on the afternoon of the 12th. September 2021 to discuss some issues.
After the meeting, the two sides will hold a joint press conference at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs.
Wang Yi arrived in Cambodia this morning for a two-day visit at the invitation of Cambodian Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation.
The two leaders will discuss various aspects of bilateral cooperation, including the fight against Kovid-19, trade and investment, education, security and defense, the Foreign Ministry said in a statement. As well as regional and international issues of common interest and concern.
