Mrs. O Vandin and Ms. Ban Srey Mom announced the closing of the first round of vaccination campaign for 19 18-year-old people in Pailin province
(Pailin): Mrs. O Vandin, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health and Chair of the National Committee for 19 Kovid Vaccination, and Ms. Ban Srey Mom, Governor of Pailin Province, co-chaired the closing ceremony of the 19-year-old Kovid vaccination campaign for 18-year-olds. 1 in Pailin province.
The Secretary of State also commended the Pailin Provincial Administration for its successful campaign against Kovid-19, including the treatment of Kovid patients, the search for affected individuals, and the vaccination campaign, which culminated in the first round. Success.
She said the closure of the vaccination campaign was only for people 18 years of age and older, while children between the ages of 12 and under 18 were still vaccinated normally. She also advised the provincial administration to keep some vaccines for migrant workers and workers who have just returned from abroad, especially workers from Thailand, so that they have the opportunity to receive vaccines for self-defense. General Knowledge: New Interpretations of Birth
We all know that there are hundreds of millions of sperm in the semen that struggle to swim to reproduce with the egg in the womb, of which only one sperm enters the egg and reacts. Adapt to grow into a baby.
Contrary to the above interpretation, the latest medical research has found that "the egg in the uterus is the one who chooses a sperm to reproduce with it, not the sperm that swims first. That no. ”
We often mistakenly think that hundreds of millions of sperm will reach all the eggs, but in reality there are only a few thousand sperm that have a chance to mature. The female immune system destroys any unwanted sperm before it runs into the egg (this is the first step in getting rid of the weak sperm before choosing again by opening the cell skin to Only sperm that need to come in).
