According to a senior official of the Royal Government of Cambodia, during this official visit, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Mr. Wang Yi will preside over the handover ceremony of the Techo Heritage National Stadium in China. Provided construction assistance to Cambodia, which will take place on the evening of September 12, 2021, if there is no change.
