According to Lt. Col. Duch Samphors, Chief of Staff of Pursat Provincial Gendarmerie Command, the above incident caused a surprise at 13:38 on September 10, 2021 between people named Man Sayon, male, 40 years old, living in Prohal village, Talor commune, Talor Senchey district, while plowing a field, found 50 M47 warheads at the steep bank of the above village / commune.
Currently, both the warhead and the grenade were rescued by the Halo Trust police force to avoid any possible danger.
