(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of September 10, 2021, Mr. Osman Hassan, Member of the Central Committee and Chairman of the Islamic Movement Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, chaired a meeting on the Zoom system nationwide to summarize the work of the Movement Committee. And strengthen the implementation of the next plan towards the 2022-2023 election.
Attending today's meeting are the leaders of the movement, who are the vice chairmen, permanent members, middle members, leaders of the movement at the capital, province, municipality, district and Khan throughout the country.
