At the same time, Mr. Sos Mousin, Member of the Central Committee and Vice Chairman of the Islamic Movement Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, mentioned the report on various activities, especially the many achievements that the Movement has achieved throughout the country. All the needs of the Islamic community as well as society as a whole.
