He urged that all members and citizens of all ages be able to register to vote, and that those who still use their old ID cards be asked to change them. Immediately re-form to meet voter registration requirements.
The Chairman of the Movement Committee instructed the leaders of the Movement Committees at all levels to increase cooperation in implementing the measures of the Ministry of Health to continue to participate in preventing the spread of Kovid 19, especially the new Delta virus, which has just spread.
